=== Phase G: platform-admin evidence ===
date: 2026-08-12T03:25:42Z

## 7 routes (platform admin, admin session)
1. GET  /console/api/account/platform-admin-status -> 200 is_platform_admin:true
2. GET  /console/api/platform-admin/workspaces -> 200 items=5 (page+total)
3. GET  /console/api/platform-admin/workspaces/{id} -> 200
4. PATCH /console/api/platform-admin/workspaces/{id} (rename) -> 200, updated_at changed
5. GET  /console/api/platform-admin/workspaces/{id}/members -> 200
6. POST /console/api/platform-admin/workspaces/{id}/members/invitations -> 201 account_created
7. PATCH /console/api/platform-admin/workspaces/{id}/members/{id}/role -> 200 editor->admin

## Owner mutation guard
PATCH owner member role -> 409 owner_operation_deferred (owner mutation deferred)

## Permission boundaries (non-platform-admin session)
status route -> is_platform_admin:false
routes 2..7 -> 403 platform_admin_required
forged X-Tenant-Id / X-Consumed-By / X-Role / X-Platform-Admin headers -> still 403 (no bypass)

## RBAC_ENABLED=true fail-closed
invite -> 503 rbac_mode_not_supported
role mutation -> 503 rbac_mode_not_supported
mutation_supported flag -> false
no DB/token/task side effects: tenant_account_joins unchanged by rejected invites

## Invitation semantics
new invite -> PENDING account + join, requires_setup=true (VALIDATION_PLAN match)

